      {
        "id": "RenektonCleave",
        "name": "巨鳄狂袭",
        "description": "雷克顿挥动他的武器，对周围所有目标造成中等水平物理伤害，并根据造成的伤害来治疗自己。如果他有50点以上怒气，那么此技能的伤害和治疗效果会得到提升。",
        "tooltip": "雷克顿挥舞他的战刃，造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (100% 额外攻击力))物理伤害</span>，此外，每命中一个非英雄单位就会回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(2/3/4/5/6 + (2% 额外攻击力))生命值</span>，每命中一位英雄就会回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(12/20/28/36/44 + (17% 额外攻击力))</span>。他每命中一个非英雄单位还会生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">2.5怒气</span>，且每命中一位英雄生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">10怒气</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气加成</span>：伤害提升至<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(90/135/180/225/270 + (140% 额外攻击力))物理伤害</span>并且对非英雄单位的治疗效果提升至<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(6/9/12/15/18 + (6% 额外攻击力))生命值</span>，对英雄的治疗效果提升至<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(36/60/84/108/132 + (51% 额外攻击力))生命值</span>。不会生成任何<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">每次施放最多获得<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">30怒气</span>。<br />基础施放至多回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">50/75/100/125/150生命值</span>。<br />强化施放至多回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">200/300/400/500/600生命值</span>。</span>",
